invariant: INV-5
file: webpki_cert.c
catches: proof/prove-one.sh webpki_cert_key
reason: the reader a leaf pinned without anchors goes through parses the
  whole TBSCertificate under the leaf arm, extensions included, where
  docs/decisions.md 65 reads the certificate only as far as its key. A
  leaf the walk would refuse for a missing subjectAltName or keyUsage bit
  is then refused under a pin that names its key. The webpki_cert_key
  harness asserts the extensions reader never runs.

--- old
    int rc = read_tbs_key(&t, out, &sigalg_tlv, &sigalg_tlv_len, alert);
--- new
    int rc = read_tbs(out->tbs, out->tbs_len, 0, out, &sigalg_tlv, &sigalg_tlv_len, alert);
